# @hub-lanes

# ── COMPONENT-WATCH LANE (BH-6972, BH-6546.2) ──────────────────────────────
# Every 15 minutes the dispatch starts one detached run per component in
# catalog/components.tsv. A run reads the component's newest 50 open alerts,
# skips with UNCHANGED when the set (ids and last_seen) did not move, and makes
# at most ONE model call (model_routes role component-watch, --max-budget-usd
# from component_watch.budget_usd). It applies resolve, park, escalate (a note)
# or files an ai-build issue (component_watch.max_tickets a run), and writes
# one alert_decisions row and one log line per decision. flock -n dedupes.
# Off: flags/lane-off-component-watch, bin/harness-ctl.sh off component-watch,
# or one component: bin/harness-ctl.sh off component-watch --project <component>.
*/15 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/component-watch.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
